WEBVTT

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.100
Dhianeila-sama!

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.810
Princess!

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:18.310
What's happening?! Age...

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:45.800
My brothers did this, didn't they?

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:53.600
I'm coming, too. Please get the
Argonaut ready to move out immediately!

00:00:54.060 --> 00:01:00.770
<b>Over and over again I wish on the dazzling star far away</b>

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:07.110
<b>Wandering heartbeats, gravitation, the story of their attraction</b>

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:27.090
<b>When did it begin? No one knows the end of it</b>

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:34.260
<b>It's not a trick or an illusion, it's a current that I can't swim against</b>

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:36.140
<b>(Dark!)</b>

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:41.270
<b>The monster that lives in the darkness</b>

00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:43.110
<b>(Blight!)</b>

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:46.570
<b>As if I were easily getting swallowed into it</b>

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:48.360
<b>(I seek a hero!)</b>

00:01:48.450 --> 00:01:51.030
<b>I awake as I truly am</b>

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:59.870
<b>If God says conflicts and life's old dreams go hand in hand</b>

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:04.750
<b>I'm looking for you even if it means ripping my body apart</b>

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:13.600
<b>With a flower held to my heart, no one can stop this heartbeat now that it's begun</b>

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:17.640
<b>We're destined to come in contact</b>

00:02:35.660 --> 00:02:41.750
No matter how enormous its strength is,
nothing can go against the flow of time.

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:46.800
Not against the power of my Erymanthos...

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:54.140
Right there! We're going to jump, Erymanthos.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:01.600
Go back to seventy seconds ago!

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:04.790
That wasn't it.

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:21.430
All you have to do is stop his movement.

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:25.480
I'm sure that's an easy task for you, Karkinos.

00:04:33.240 --> 00:04:35.200
Is it right there?

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.720
Lecty!

00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:58.430
Don't worry.

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:42.800
She's already made so many jumps...

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:50.770
It has to be somewhere... the
branching point where I can destroy just him.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:53.480
The past that should be possible...

00:06:19.090 --> 00:06:23.050
Big Brother, the assembly of the
remaining fleets has been completed.

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:25.720
There's no sign of the Tribe of Silver's
ships in the Identification zone.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:30.390
We believe that they have retreated to Mars,
the next terminal planet on the starway.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:33.560
So they ran away, huh? How about the Nodos?

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:37.530
He's still fighting the enemy Nodos.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:41.740
It's been over thirty hours.
He is a monster, for sure.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:46.950
All troops, resume the advance!

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:50.330
We will proceed on the path
that our Nodos opened up for us,

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:54.040
and regain the planet of war, Mars!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.960
Because of the destruction of Jupiter,

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:01.840
the starways are now linked
up between Mars and Saturn,

00:07:01.930 --> 00:07:03.510
and they seem to be stable.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.350
So, we didn't have to lose the starway

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.680
thanks to the fact that the distance
between the planets was short.

00:07:08.770 --> 00:07:12.190
Yes, the entire fleet
could have ended up adrift.

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:15.360
But we got completely
separated from the units behind us.

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:18.070
The fact is, we're now alone and unaided.

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:25.740
All units have been ordered to
advance on Mars immediately.

00:07:28.290 --> 00:07:31.540
I knew this was going to happen... Those fools!

00:07:31.620 --> 00:07:35.210
Kicking up their heels as soon as the
enemy's disappeared from their sight?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:38.710
It's obvious that the enemy
is lying in wait on Mars.

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:42.340
Should we suggest to the king that we rendezvous
with the unit that was behind us, ma'am?

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.260
He's not going to listen to us, anyway.

00:07:44.340 --> 00:07:47.550
I know he'll just continue to rely on
Age and take reckless steps forward.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:51.640
If that's the case, it's possible that
the same thing that happened to Jupiter

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:53.140
might happen to Mars...

00:07:53.230 --> 00:07:56.560
And if that happened, we'd either
turn the Earth into a battleground

00:07:56.650 --> 00:08:00.480
or finally lose the starway
and find ourselves adrift.

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:04.450
We're going to seize authority
from them before that happens.

00:08:09.830 --> 00:08:15.460
The god's star has died...
Isn't the star of brilliance awakening yet?

00:08:27.140 --> 00:08:29.800
Communication with the heavy
ship Surveyor has been lost!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:32.180
How could they...

00:08:45.450 --> 00:08:47.820
Aneasha.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:49.280
Captain.

00:08:49.370 --> 00:08:52.620
Special representatives from the
planet Colonis, and the planet Orion,

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:55.330
are requesting an audience with the princess.

00:08:56.710 --> 00:08:58.670
I'll be right there.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:08.470
We're extremely honored to have you
with us on our planet, Princess Dhianeila.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:13.520
I'm most thankful to the planet
Colonis and the planet Orion

00:09:13.600 --> 00:09:17.230
for kindly agreeing to our
request on such short notice.

00:09:17.310 --> 00:09:19.350
Your kind words are more than I deserve.

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:26.700
To us, your power to find a path away from
the starway in the darkness of space is godly.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:31.830
Being able to assist you
gives us the utmost pleasure.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:35.080
Please feel free to ask
us for anything you need.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:42.340
We're most certain that the power of
Princess Dhianeila will lead us to victory.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:44.380
Thank you.

00:09:58.600 --> 00:10:01.100
The Tribe of Iron is moving forward.

00:10:01.190 --> 00:10:03.820
It looks like they're coming from the front.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:06.530
Let's end it right here.

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:11.410
This time, this place is
going to be a battleground.

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.950
This planet is going to be killed as well...

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:22.580
We will stop him before that happens.

00:11:11.090 --> 00:11:13.720
You're two against one! What's taking so long?

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.190
Lecty!

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:31.570
You monster...

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:32.300
The option where only he gets destroyed
has to be somewhere in the space-time flow.

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:06.330
The Nodos is coming closer.

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:09.460
He must be led by the starway.

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.880
All four Nodos in one place...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.590
This could cause madness.

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.980
Going back seventy seconds isn't good enough?

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.190
Lecty?

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:35.490
His absoluteness is beyond
the range of the current jump...

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:40.110
If I jump any further I could be hit by the
backlash from the energy of the space-time flow.

00:13:40.200 --> 00:13:43.990
Don't push yourself too
hard, Lecty. I'll do the rest...

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:45.700
Don't worry.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:49.290
I won't let you fight.

00:13:50.670 --> 00:13:53.550
Let's jump, Erymanthos.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:57.260
With all the power that's available to us!

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:33.140
It can't be happening! Does this mean
he's absolute in the space-time flow?

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:55.920
I sense no doubt from
the fifth Nodos whatsoever.

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:01.380
A being that follows the
agreement that's given to him.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:07.550
Why did the Tribe of Gold give
such a being to the Tribe of Iron?

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:08.890
To test us.

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:12.730
To test whether we, the Tribe of Silver,
could truly govern this universe

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:16.100
in the place of the Tribe of Gold.

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:21.730
Right now, the fifth Nodos is
trying to divide the universe in half.

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:25.860
There's no stopping it,
and it'll eventually lead to...

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:30.910
The destruction created
by the Tribe of Hero. Or...

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:41.380
More and more rescue
fleets are coming together now.

00:16:41.460 --> 00:16:43.880
Let us move out as soon as possible!

00:16:43.970 --> 00:16:48.430
Not just yet. There are more rescue
units behind us. Wait until they're all here.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:51.760
While we sit around like this Age is still
out there, being forced to fight by himself,

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:55.520
and the fleet will remain in harm's
way because of this reckless advance!

00:16:55.600 --> 00:17:00.310
If we move out now, we'll only end up finding
ourselves; being under the control of Meleagros.

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:02.780
That would be pointless.

00:17:02.860 --> 00:17:06.320
Master, you have an incoming call
from Lieutenant General Nilval.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:11.830
At Jupiter time 1 9:05, the Federation
fleet will resume their advance on Mars.

00:17:11.910 --> 00:17:13.870
What did you say?

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:19.630
I'm afraid that this is a reckless advance,
and they are relying on Age to cover them.

00:17:19.710 --> 00:17:22.340
At this rate, the entire
fleet could end up perishing

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:25.380
along with the Earth we are
supposed to be reclaiming.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:31.550
Even after destroying Jupiter,
the planet of an ancient god...

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:37.310
We have no time to waste. Princess,
reorganizing the fleets is extremely urgent.

00:17:37.390 --> 00:17:39.690
Please make a decision.

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:47.200
Dhianeila-sama.

00:17:47.280 --> 00:17:50.990
Aneasha, I...

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:55.700
Just believe in yourself. Please.

00:18:04.420 --> 00:18:06.050
Lecty!

00:18:08.510 --> 00:18:15.390
This is my 1 8,000th loss...

00:18:15.470 --> 00:18:18.770
I'll go! If I fight alongside with Karkinos

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:20.810
Don't do it, Mehitak!

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:31.410
He can't control himself like Karkinos can.
If he fights against more than two Nodos...

00:18:31.490 --> 00:18:33.320
Madness...

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:40.040
When the madness of the Tribe of Hero
led them to almost destroy this universe...

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:44.880
...only the Tribe of Gold was able to stop them.

00:18:44.960 --> 00:18:47.380
But at this rate

00:18:47.460 --> 00:18:53.850
Erymanthos and I will try
every option within our power.

00:18:53.930 --> 00:19:02.150
There must be a past somewhere
where we can destroy him.

00:19:02.230 --> 00:19:03.190
Lecty...

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.480
Trust me.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:26.630
Karkinos!

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:32.300
His attacking power is exceeding
Lernaea's power to recover.

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:37.720
Both Mehitak and Lecty are useless!
While Karkinos is still okay, I can get him

00:19:37.810 --> 00:19:40.350
No.
 Rom Ror!

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:42.730
Why are you flustered?

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:54.030
"Flustered" ...

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:57.780
I don't... have emotions!

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:14.300
What is this?

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:15.380
What?

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:19.100
The space-time flow's
backlash is closing in on me...

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.440
Another dimension...

00:20:24.520 --> 00:20:32.280
The impact I took in a different timeline
is about to converge with this real time.

00:20:44.920 --> 00:20:47.040
Wh-What is this? What's going on?

00:20:47.130 --> 00:20:54.090
My energy... Erymanthos' energy from
20,000 jumps will gather in one place.

00:20:54.170 --> 00:21:00.470
All the energy will flow into
whichever one of us gives up first.

00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:54.230
Lecty!

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:56.320
Run!

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:59.030
I said, run! Mehitak!

00:22:23.850 --> 00:22:25.470
Age...

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:34.110
Although I have known you for a long time

00:22:34.190 --> 00:22:41.530
l never dreamed these feelings would sprout

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:46.700
And I would fall in love with you

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:57.590
Casually going home,
as I look at the stars in the night sky

00:22:57.670 --> 00:23:10.480
l take the long way on purpose
and lean on your shoulder as we walk

00:23:10.560 --> 00:23:21.740
You tell me you think we can overcome
anything as long as we stay together

00:23:21.820 --> 00:23:26.910
I think as I look into your forthright eyes

00:23:26.990 --> 00:23:33.250
That I love you

00:23:37.050 --> 00:23:41.220
Changes in Belcross.
That is the beginning of madness.

00:23:41.300 --> 00:23:45.260
Next time on Heroic Age,
Episode 14: "The Raging One."
